stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Anonymous

    Anonymous --> SigningUp: Click signup
    SigningUp --> EmailVerify: Email + password submitted
    EmailVerify --> Authenticated: Email confirmed

    Anonymous --> SigningIn: Click login
    SigningIn --> Authenticating: Credentials / OAuth
    Authenticating --> Authenticated: Success
    Authenticating --> Anonymous: Failure

    Authenticated --> SessionActive: JWT issued<br/>(sub, org_id, role, is_project_owner)
    SessionActive --> SessionActive: User actions<br/>JWT in every request

    SessionActive --> Refreshing: Access token expires (1h)
    Refreshing --> SessionActive: Refresh token valid
    Refreshing --> Anonymous: Refresh expired

    SessionActive --> OrgCreation: No membership found
    OrgCreation --> SessionActive: Org created<br/>owner → org_admin

    SessionActive --> Invited: User accepts invite
    Invited --> SessionActive: Membership created

    SessionActive --> SigningOut: Logout
    SigningOut --> Anonymous

    Anonymous --> [*]

    note right of Authenticated
        Backend verifies every JWT
        with Supabase JWKS.
        Custom claims hook injects
        org_id + role at issuance.
    end note
